00:09:13.280 --> 00:09:15.930
So we're going to apply this to
this first term here,

00:09:16.790 --> 00:09:22.350
and we will get f of x equals 9x to the

00:09:22.200 --> 00:09:22.630
12,

00:09:23.460 --> 00:09:25.230
And then we can do plus here.

00:09:25.950 --> 00:09:31.510
I'll take this 9 out, and we know our x is in
