00:10:04.500 --> 00:10:10.000
f prime of x equals 9 times

00:10:09.850 --> 00:10:14.420
12x to the 11. 12 minus 1 is
going to be 11.

00:10:14.890 --> 00:10:19.000
Then we have plus 9, negative 2 over

